# Frontend (.env.local, read by Vite). Copy to .env.local and fill in.
# `npx convex dev` writes CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT and VITE_CONVEX_URL for you.
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://<your-deployment>.convex.cloud
# Base URL of the agent services. Leave empty in local dev: Vite proxies
# /agent2, /agent7 and /agent-negotiation to localhost (see vite.config.ts).
VITE_AGENT_URL=

# Convex backend variables are NOT read from this file. Set them on the
# deployment with `npx convex env set NAME value`:
#   GOOGLE_API_KEY   (required) Gemini API key used by the tutor and assignment generation
#   GEMINI_MODEL     (optional) defaults to gemini-3.5-flash
#   AGENT_SECRET     (required for agents) shared secret; must match agents/.env
#   AGENT1_URL       (optional) e.g. https://<agent1-host>; when set, the tutor asks Agent 1
#                    for the Socratic question and falls back to direct Gemini if it is down
#   RESEND_API_KEY, RESEND_FROM_EMAIL (optional) email notifications
